# SpFormatter

SourcePawn formatter (.NET 10, `SpFormatter.slnx`).

Before changing behavior, read:

- `AGENTS.md`
- `docs/ARCHITECTURE.md`
- `docs/STYLE.md`
- `docs/SUPPORTED.md`
- `docs/AI_WORKFLOW.md`
- `docs/ROADMAP.md`

## Hard rules

- One construct or one printer layer per session. Do not try to green the whole suite.
- Prefer new `AstPrinter` / `LayoutRules` / `FormatResult` paths over patches in the legacy god class.
- No new regex or string post-processors on clean trees.
- No new `HasError` special-cases without updating `docs/SUPPORTED.md`.
- Do not invent options the engine does not honor.
- Do not mass-update goldens to hide failures.
- Commit logical chunks with lowercase subjects and short human bodies. No em-dashes, no filler language.
